@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = change-me-use-a-random-key-of-at-least-32-chars
@paymentId = substitua-pelo-uuid-retornado

### Criar PIX
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: exemplo-pix-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "description": "Assinatura mensal",
  "amount": "150.90",
  "paymentMethod": "PIX"
}

### Consultar e obter ETag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/{{paymentId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Liquidar PIX pendente; substitua a versão pelo ETag atual
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/{{paymentId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
If-Match: "1"
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"PAID"}

### Filtrar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payment?cpf=52998224725&paymentMethod=PIX&limit=20
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Criar cartão; requer configuração MP e worker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: exemplo-cartao-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "description": "Compra de teste",
  "amount": "150.90",
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
